    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]",
      "translation" : "[年轻男子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh man...",
      "translation" : "唉..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It all started when my parents passed away when I was a little kid. Early on I had to work for a living, and had a really hard time.",
      "translation" : "这一切都要从我小时候父母去世说起。我很早就得靠工作谋生，日子过得非常艰难。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]",
      "translation" : "[年轻男子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I've worked for 10 years in hopes of buying my dream house where I could find some sense of peace and comfort again. Eventually I thought I had enough zeny to afford my very own sweet home.",
      "translation" : "为了买下一栋能让我重新感到安宁舒适的理想住宅，我努力工作了10年。后来我以为自己攒够了泽尼，终于能拥有温馨的家。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]",
      "translation" : "[年轻男子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Unfortunately I didn't have enough money to buy the nice house that I had my eye on. But then, I found this house, which was bigger and cheaper than the first. I bought it without thinking...",
      "translation" : "很遗憾，我的钱不够买中意的那栋房子。后来我发现这栋房子更大也更便宜，没多想就买了下来..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]",
      "translation" : "[年轻男子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sweet Jesus! Turns out, it's a Heaven for Thief Bugs!!!",
      "translation" : "天哪！没想到这里竟是盗虫的天堂！！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]",
      "translation" : "[年轻男子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I tried to do everything I could do. I coaxed them, killed them, but it only brought peace for a moment! I even tried to burn this house down...!",
      "translation" : "我什么办法都试过了。哄过它们，也杀过它们，可只能换来片刻安宁！我甚至想过烧掉这栋房子...！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]",
      "translation" : "[年轻男子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "*Gasp* I mean, really, do I need ^3355FF Ora Ora^000000 to get rid of them? People say it is very rarely seen in distant countries.",
      "translation" : "*喘气*我是说，我真的需要^3355FF奥拉奥拉^000000才能赶走它们吗？听说那东西在遥远的国度也很罕见。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]",
      "translation" : "[年轻男子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If I could afford 5 of them, I won't have to be frustrated with these disgusting bugs any more...",
      "translation" : "要是我买得起5个，就再也不用被这些恶心的虫子折磨了..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]",
      "translation" : "[年轻男子]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Boy",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This never ending fight with the bugs has really exhausted me. I give up. Do as you wish you scumbags!",
      "translation" : "和这些虫子没完没了地斗争让我筋疲力尽。我放弃了。你们这些混蛋爱怎样就怎样吧！"
